#: ../../user/installation.md:23
msgid "Install (planned, post Phase 1 release)"
msgstr "インストール（Phase 1 リリース後の予定）"

#: ../../user/installation.md:29
msgid ""
"`@rescript-tauri/core` declares `@tauri-apps/api` as a `peerDependency`, "
"so the two are versioned independently and you control the upstream Tauri"
" version."
msgstr ""
"`@rescript-tauri/core` は `@tauri-apps/api` を `peerDependency` "
"として宣言しているため、両者は独立してバージョン管理され、上流 Tauri のバージョンは利用者側で制御できます。"

#: ../../user/installation.md:31
msgid "Then add `@rescript-tauri/core` to `dependencies` in your `rescript.json`:"
msgstr "次に `rescript.json` の `dependencies` に `@rescript-tauri/core` を追加します:"

#: ../../user/installation.md:41
msgid "Phase 2 add-on packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/installation.md:43
msgid ""
"Each Phase 2 package is published independently. Install them as needed "
"alongside the matching upstream plugin / schema library:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/installation.md:57
msgid ""
"See the [plugin-fs](plugin-fs.md), [plugin-dialog](plugin-dialog.md), and"
" [schema](schema.md) guides for the matching ReScript / Rust / capability"
" setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/installation.md:61
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "動作確認"

#: ../../user/installation.md:63
msgid "After Phase 1 ships, a minimal verification looks like:"
msgstr "Phase 1 リリース後、最小の動作確認は次のようになります:"

#: ../../user/installation.md:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Combined with a Rust-side `#[tauri::command] fn ping() {}`, this round-"
"trip confirms the bridge works."
msgstr "Rust 側の `#[tauri::command] fn ping() {}` と組み合わせれば、この往復でブリッジが機能することを確認できます。"

#: ../../user/installation.md:71
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "トラブルシューティング"

#: ../../user/installation.md:73
msgid ""
"Detailed troubleshooting will be added as Phase 1 implementation reveals "
"common pitfalls. For early feedback, please open an issue at "
"[github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/issues](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/issues)."
msgstr ""
"詳細なトラブルシューティングは、Phase 1 実装によって典型的な落とし穴が明らかになるにつれて追加します。早期のフィードバックは "
"[github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/issues](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/issues) に Issue を起票してください。"

